<title>ITALY: Edison 1996 cons net profit 370 bln lire.</title>
<headline>Edison 1996 cons net profit 370 bln lire.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian energy group Edison on Thursday announced a 1996 consolidated net profit of 370 billion lire, up 38 percent from 1995 net profit of 268 billion lire.</p>
<p>The group, which is majority controlled by Montedison SpA, said its parent company was proposing to pay a 1996 dividend of 200 lire a share, up from 190 lire in 1995.</p>
<p>Edison added in a statement that its consolidated sales for 1996 rose 46 percent to 1.887 trillion lire, while its gross operating margin rose 30 percent to 898 billion lire.</p>
</text>
